# Everything a build stage should never see. Keeps the context small and stops
# a developer's .env from being baked into an image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-electron
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/release
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
.claude

**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

docs
*.md
!README.md

data/price-lists
**/*.xlsx
**/*.sqlite
docker/volumes
